      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄以优秀的表现累积着战果。\n看完她的表现后，\n现场观众们──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c62861bcbc692c594ea298bf03126883cbb19ab0db56c33a77364ba8680df3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
