    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e165089e209454954ba14f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便嘴上称赞今日比赛，\n却更加热中谈论那位拥有“大王”别称的赛马娘。\n据说那位赛马娘的未来动向相当值得期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60dafc8be8e0ffa290eeeac0b4200690120a875e7207303b88272a449330ca88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
