    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cc8be064d1738ac85e20d70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄全力以赴地跑完了“宝冢纪念”。\n却只见竞赛相关节目全都在争相报导那位\n于“日本德比”缔造创举的“最强的大王”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ff8bc1b8061504007c4ba57848bdfe4e222268b64751319d56cd6efaa905d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
