    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0764f121f72be66d3afd0ef9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄似乎并未因此气馁……\n她将下一个目标定为“天皇赏（秋）”，\n并决心要继续一点一滴累积实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74b2ad688bb090c92d8b772aac5022088e298abe0c8a64343900599f4e8d8f88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
