      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是“日本杯”。\n她发誓绝对要达成“秋古马三冠”，\n成为真正的英雄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7fffca2bf6853d530cca7083be81e596988e5576cd8195ddcb3389c6c952f32",
