      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋季第二冠在荒漠英雄的头顶闪耀。\n她精彩地达成了连霸\n“天皇赏（秋）”与“日本杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e4ba76d4d7abff287033ee5c7f053a7a773091894c72859a7f333400ede6c1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
