    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9c4ce9d32a4a0c35044edbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着是“有马纪念”。\n只差一步就能达成史上第二人的创举。\n眼下只须继续奋勇迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e171eaa4b9cfd293a47a6b3dd4430061c888caa8a47cb83c8c9dd12a5b4fac6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
