    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aada7c6cd3228821add25baf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆开口说道。\n若说能带给他人勇气者就是所谓的英雄……\n“你──就是我的‘英雄’”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c9d6c0e51a0ce26cad4968cd20e545d71fe07fc9910e94a455c2a65f1be5c8",
